  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><section class=\"relative bg-racing-900 text-white overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><video src=\"/assets/aurora-a78de3e2.webm\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" autoplay=\"1\" loop=\"1\" playsinline=\"1\"></video><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-racing-900/90\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 container mx-auto px-4 py-8 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight animate-fade-in\">Sell your enthusiast car or motorcycle at auction.</h1><div class=\"trustpilot-widget mb-4\" data-locale=\"en-US\" data-template-id=\"5419b732fbfb950b10de65e5\" data-businessunit-id=\"62386e172adef886c504f06e\" data-style-height=\"24px\" data-style-width=\"100%\" data-theme=\"dark\" data-token=\"40741a57-c542-4486-88c8-250259092c7c\" data-min-review-count=\"0\" data-style-alignment=\"center\"><a href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/biddershighway.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trustpilot</a></div><div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8 py-4 lg:py-6 border border-white/20\"><h3 class=\"mb-4\">Sell in seven days with a low seller fee - fill in the fields below.</h3><tracking-controller><form data-props=\"{}\" data-action=\"tracking#register\" data-event=\"seller_apply\" data-title=\"main_form\" class=\"space-y-4\" id=\"new_lead\" action=\"/en/sales_inquiries\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" method=\"post\"><input name=\"lead[accept_terms]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\" autocomplete=\"off\"><input class=\"absolute -z-10\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\" name=\"lead[accept_terms]\" id=\"lead_accept_terms\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"flex\"><div class=\"rounded-l-md overflow-hidden bg-blue-700 flex items-center px-1\"><img src=\"/assets/reg-plate-d7f5d504.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"w-4 md:w-5\"></div><input placeholder=\"Car registration number\" class=\"border-2 border-stone-300 bg-white text-base py-2 md:py-3 px-5 focus:border-jaffa focus:ring-2 focus:ring-jaffa/20 transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 w-full rounded-r-md\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" name=\"lead[registration_number]\" id=\"lead_registration_number\"></div><input placeholder=\"E-mail\" class=\"border-2 border-stone-300 bg-white text-base py-2 md:py-3 px-5 focus:border-jaffa focus:ring-2 focus:ring-jaffa/20 transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 w-full rounded-md\" autocomplete=\"email\" required=\"required\" type=\"email\" name=\"lead[email]\" id=\"lead_email\"><input placeholder=\"Phone number\" class=\"border-2 border-stone-300 bg-white text-base py-2 md:py-3 px-5 focus:border-jaffa focus:ring-2 focus:ring-jaffa/20 transition-all placeholder:text-stone-400 w-full rounded-md\" type=\"tel\" autocomplete=\"tel\" required=\"required\" name=\"lead[phone]\" id=\"lead_phone\"></div><input autocomplete=\"off\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"seller_apply\" name=\"lead[lead_generator]\" id=\"lead_lead_generator\"><input autocomplete=\"off\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"lead[utm_source]\" id=\"lead_utm_source\"><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><input type=\"submit\" name=\"commit\" value=\"Submit\" class=\"bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg cursor-pointer transition-all transform shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl w-full sm:w-auto\" data-disable-with=\"Create Inquiry\"></div><p class=\"text-xs text-white/80 text-center leading-snug\">Registering interest is free and non-binding.</p></form></tracking-controller></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/en/collection_leads/new\" class=\"border-2 border-jaffa text-jaffa hover:bg-jaffa hover:text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 inline-block\">Sell a vehicle collection</a><a href=\"/en/estate-sales/new\" class=\"border-2 border-jaffa text-jaffa hover:bg-jaffa hover:text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 inline-block\">Sell an estate</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-4 border-b border-stone-200\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-4 text-sm text-stone-600\"><div class=\"flex gap-1 items-center\"><span class=\"icon text-racing-700 text-xl\">shield</span><span class=\"font-medium\">BankID verified</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-1 items-center\"><span class=\"icon text-racing-700 text-xl\">check_circle</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Secure auction platform</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-1 items-center\"><span class=\"icon text-racing-700 text-xl\">handshake</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Verified bidders</span></div></div></div></section><p class=\"text-center text-stone-600 italic max-w-4xl mx-auto my-4 lg:my-8 px-4 leading-relaxed\">Auction is the proven smartest way to sell your enthusiast vehicle - we have an international and niche reach that finds the right buyer at the right price. Timed bidding over 7 days creates momentum and buying desire, while professional photos, video, and a well-written listing boost bidding enthusiasm.</p><section class=\"py-8 lg:py-20 bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-6 lg:mb-12\">Why sell with us</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 md:text-sm transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-jaffa/10 rounded-full mb-6\"><span class=\"icon text-3xl text-jaffa\">star</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Smooth process</h3><ul class=\"text-left space-y-2 mt-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>The car stays at home throughout the entire auction</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Reach 50,000 enthusiasts at once</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Low fee, photo and advertising included</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 md:text-sm transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-jaffa/10 rounded-full mb-6\"><span class=\"icon text-3xl text-jaffa\">shield</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Safe &amp; verified</h3><ul class=\"text-left space-y-2 mt-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Low seller fee</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>All bidders are verified with BankID or credit card details</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>All contact goes through us - safe and smooth</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 md:text-sm transform hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-jaffa/10 rounded-full mb-6\"><span class=\"icon text-3xl text-jaffa\">public</span></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Right buyers</h3><ul class=\"text-left space-y-2 mt-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Your vehicle reaches a dedicated audience of enthusiasts - in Sweden and internationally</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-x-2 text-stone-700\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-base/0\">check_circle</span></div><span>Sell in seven days - quick and easy</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-8 lg:py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-6 lg:mb-12\">How it works</h2><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md flex gap-4 items-stretch\" data-step=\"1\"><div class=\"text-8xl md:text-9xl font-black text-racing-900 leading-none flex-shrink-0 self-stretch flex items-center\">1</div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Describe your car</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Fill out the form. Our specialists will help you achieve a successful sale.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md flex gap-4 items-stretch\" data-step=\"2\"><div class=\"text-8xl md:text-9xl font-black text-racing-900 leading-none flex-shrink-0 self-stretch flex items-center\">2</div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Set a reserve price</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Your vehicle is appraised and we agree on a suitable reserve price. We interview you about the car's condition, history, documentation and other relevant details for the auction.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md flex gap-4 items-stretch\" data-step=\"3\"><div class=\"text-8xl md:text-9xl font-black text-racing-900 leading-none flex-shrink-0 self-stretch flex items-center\">3</div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">We create the listing</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">The car is professionally photographed and we write an attractive listing which you approve. No unwanted visitors and phone calls.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md flex gap-4 items-stretch\" data-step=\"4\"><div class=\"text-8xl md:text-9xl font-black text-racing-900 leading-none flex-shrink-0 self-stretch flex items-center\">4</div><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">You get the result</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">The auction runs for seven days. When the final bid reaches the reserve price, you and the buyer arrange payment and delivery. All bids are saved and verified with Swedish BankID and credit card.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-8 lg:py-20 bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-6 lg:mb-12\">What our customers say</h2></div></section><section class=\"py-8 bg-racing-900 text-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"bg-racing-900\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-4 lg:py-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">200 000+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Visitors/month</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">30 000+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Registered users</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">150+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Images per auction</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">250 MSEK+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Bid volume/month</span></div></div></div></div></